Houston is a large metropolitan area, so convenience can play an important role in maintaining consistent appointments.

Think about:

- Whether you prefer a therapist close to your home or workplace.
- Whether the practice offers the type of counseling you need.
- Whether your insurance plan is accepted.
- Whether the clinician has relevant professional qualifications.
- Whether online appointments are available.
- Whether the practice offers a consultation before beginning ongoing therapy.

